-是吃枪子儿  -亲爱的  你在干嘛
-Lead. -Honey, what are you doing?

518
00:19:15,699 --> 00:19:17,271
抱歉牧师  吉时已过
Sorry, padre, you had your chance.

519
00:19:17,312 --> 00:19:19,022
我宣布你正式死亡
I now pronounce you dead!

520
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:22,128
你什么时候...
When in the world did --

521
00:19:22,515 --> 00:19:24,141
一个死人咋这么多问题呢
A lot of questions for a cadaver!

522
00:19:26,520 --> 00:19:28,690
你们没看出来吗  这两个人是一伙的
Don't you see? These twos is in on it together!

523
00:19:28,700 --> 00:19:30,560
少管闲事  贱人
Mind your own potatoes, Daisy.

524
00:19:31,615 --> 00:19:32,661
不好意思
Excuse me.

525
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:34,084
这是老娘的婚礼
This is my wedding

526
00:19:34,104 --> 00:19:35,522
与你们的丧礼
and your funeral!

527
00:19:36,540 --> 00:19:38,121
小白脸也吃子弹吧
And one for the choir boy!

528
00:19:39,510 --> 00:19:39,681
没中
Missed me.

529
00:19:44,460 --> 00:19:48,041
你们还有兴趣再刷一个东西吗
Hey, uh, you guys feel like doing one more paint job?

530
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:50,280
不过这次是我们一起刷
Only all of us this time?

531
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:52,082
没问题
Sure.

532
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,255
有时人生比我们想得简单
Sometimes life can be simpler than we think.

533
00:19:55,869 --> 00:19:56,370
我们出生...
We're born...

534
00:19:56,380 --> 00:19:58,750
或许我们应该收留小帕与孩子
You know, um, maybe we should let Pam and the baby

535
00:19:58,760 --> 00:20:00,221
在楼上住一阵子
stay upstairs for a little while.

536
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:03,602
米奇尔刚才说...  不对  他不喜欢我这样
Mitchell was just saying -- No, he hates when I do that.

537
00:20:04,215 --> 00:20:05,911
我刚才在想  或许你跟孩子
I was just saying that maybe you and the baby

538
00:20:05,932 --> 00:20:08,009
应该在我们楼上先住段时间
should stay upstairs for a while?

539
00:20:08,029 --> 00:20:08,253
小卡
Oh, Cam!

540
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:10,330
我们去世
...we die...

541
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:12,220
你们是恶魔佳酿上脑  都疯了吧
You're all mad with the devil's brew!

542
00:20:12,230 --> 00:20:13,270
来自1916年无声电影《再来一杯恶魔佳酿》
恶魔佳酿指的是鸦片

543
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:14,621
而在这之间
...and in between...

544
00:20:15,140 --> 00:20:18,161
如果运气好  我们会有欢笑
Ah! ...if we're lucky, we laugh...

545
00:20:19,560 --> 00:20:21,981
而这趟人生旅途也就值了
...which makes the journey worth taking.

546
00:20:22,420 --> 00:20:23,810
听完这番话之后
With that in mind...

547
00:20:23,820 --> 00:20:27,841
弗兰克·邓菲  我认识最傻气的一个人
Do you, Frank Dunphy, the silliest man I know...

548
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:31,401
愿意娶洛林来折磨她一辈子吗
...take Lorraine to be your long-suffering wife?

549
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:32,461
我愿意
I do.

550
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:35,481
你可以亲你的娘子了
You may kiss the tomato.

551
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:49,553
先生  你一个小时前就该上床啦
Your bedtime was an hour ago senor.

552
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:51,850
我想先读完这本书
I wanna finish this.

553
00:20:51,860 --> 00:20:53,760
你都不认字
You don't even know how to read.

554
00:20:53,780 --> 00:20:56,410
别担心了  楼上没有怪物
Stop worrying. There is no monster up stairs.

555
00:20:56,420 --> 00:20:57,601
那漆很管用的
That paint works.

556
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:59,420
妈咪  你能去检查一下吗
Mommy, can you check it?

557
00:20:59,780 --> 00:21:00,362
好啦
Okay.

558
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:04,897
你妈连这块又旧又粘的防水布都不让我丢
Your mother won't even let me get rid of this sticky old tarp.

559
00:21:04,917 --> 00:21:06,120
她对什么东西都抱著不放
She's attached to everything.

560
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:08,080
很快你就会享受到这件事的好处了
Someday soon that will work in your favor.

561
00:21:09,750 --> 00:21:10,881
小心那个水泥砖
Careful that cinder block.

562
00:21:10,901 --> 00:21:12,781
拜托  你就是推也推不动它
Man, you couldn't budge that thing with it.

563
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:25,181
棒  这下还有个沼泽怪物了
Great, now I have a swamp monster.
